			(property "Description" "NORMALLY-CLOSED 12V DC solenoid irrigation valve. Normally-closed is a safety requirement, not a preference: it is what makes loss of 12V close the valve mechanically. Latching valves must NOT be used - they hold their last state."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(effects
					(font
						(size 1.27 1.27)
					)
					(hide yes)
				)
